=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Proto.life&amp;rft.atitle=What+the+bankruptcy+of+CARD+teaches+us+about+private+equity+in+autism+care&amp;rft.date=2023-07&amp;rft.aulast=Ponsford&amp;rft.aufirst=Matthew&amp;rft.au=Ruair%C3%AD+Casey&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fproto.life%2F2023%2F07%2Fprivate-equity-autism%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ACenter+for+Autism+and+Related+Disorders" class="Z3988" about="#mwt67" id="mwAZ8"></span></span></li>
